{
  "name": "Redis Cache Warming Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 2 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Off-Peak Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Popular Queries"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Popular Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "={{ $json.sql_query }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Execute Query Against DB",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [680, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst cacheKey = $('Read Popular Queries').first().json.cache_key;\nconst ttl = $('Read Popular Queries').first().json.ttl_seconds || 3600;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    cache_key: cacheKey,\n    cache_value: JSON.stringify(items.map(i => i.json)),\n    ttl: ttl\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Prepare Cache Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=http://your-redis-api:6380/api/cache/{{ $json.cache_key }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_REDIS_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "value",
              "value": "={{ $json.cache_value }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ttl",
              "value": "={{ $json.ttl }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Populate Redis Cache",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst results = items.map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    cache_key: item.json.cache_key || 'unknown',\n    status: item.json.statusCode === 200 ? 'SUCCESS' : 'FAILED',\n    response_code: item.json.statusCode,\n    warmed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}));\nreturn results;"
      },
      "name": "Process Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1340, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Cache Warming Log"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log Results to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1560, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Redis Cache Warming Pipeline\n\n**Schedule:** Daily at 2:00 AM (off-peak)\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Read popular query definitions from Google Sheets\n2. Execute each query against PostgreSQL\n3. Prepare JSON payload with TTL\n4. PUT to Redis HTTP API to warm cache\n5. Log results back to Sheets\n\n**Setup:**\n- Google Sheets with columns: cache_key, sql_query, ttl_seconds\n- PostgreSQL credentials\n- Redis HTTP API endpoint and token\n- Adjust schedule for your off-peak hours",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, -60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Off-Peak Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Popular Queries",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Popular Queries": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Execute Query Against DB",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Execute Query Against DB": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Cache Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Cache Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Populate Redis Cache",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Populate Redis Cache": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process Results": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Results to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}